<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Wi-Fi keeps dropping?<br><span>Find the pattern first.</span></h1>
<p class="ed-deck">Compare devices, rooms and symptoms before buying equipment. Start with a useful observation.</p>
</div></header>
<article class="ed-guide bg-canvas py-12 md:py-16" aria-label="Wi-Fi dropout diagnosis guide"><div class="ed-layout">
